# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "douglasdev.cn@gmail.com",
  "password": 1234
}
###

@authToken = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

@endpoint = /chatbots

#### 1) Listar chatbots (exclui complementares)
GET {{url}}{{endpoint}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

#### 2) Listar fluxos complementares
GET {{url}}{{endpoint}}?type=complementar
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

#### 3) Buscar chatbot por id
GET {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

#### 4) Criar chatbot de entrada (troque channel_id por um canal existente)
POST {{url}}{{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Atendimento inicial",
  "type": "entrada",
  "channel_id": 1
}

###

#### 5) Criar fluxo complementar (sem canal)
POST {{url}}{{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Verificar horário comercial",
  "type": "complementar"
}

###

#### 6) Tentar criar 2º chatbot de entrada no mesmo canal -> deve recusar
POST {{url}}{{endpoint}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Outro fluxo de entrada",
  "type": "entrada",
  "channel_id": 1
}

###

#### 7) Atualizar chatbot (nome, ativo, settings)
PATCH {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "name": "Atendimento inicial (editado)",
  "settings": { "alerta_inatividade": { "ativo": true, "tempo_minutos": 10 } }
}

###

#### 8) Ver o rascunho do fluxo (nasce só com o nó Início)
GET {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1/flow
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

#### 9) Salvar o grafo do rascunho
PUT {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1/flow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "nodes": [
    { "id": "start", "type": "start", "position": { "x": 0, "y": 0 }, "data": {} },
    { "id": "n1", "type": "message", "position": { "x": 200, "y": 0 }, "data": { "value": "Olá!" } }
  ],
  "edges": [
    { "id": "e1", "source": "start", "sourceHandle": null, "target": "n1", "targetHandle": null }
  ]
}

###

#### 10) Remover chatbot (soft delete)
DELETE {{url}}{{endpoint}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
